{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SPACE RESTAURANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space Restaurant</strong> is a management and simulation game where you manage an automation-based restaurant in the depths of space. <strong>Play solo or with your friends</strong> and open a restaurant under a business license granted by SYN CORP, serving customers, optimizing production processes, and growing your business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-op Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Play with up to 8 friends and manage your restaurant together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Automation</strong> \u2013 Level up as you earn income and let machines take care of repetitive tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Freely</strong> \u2013 Design and expand your restaurant however you want. Customize everything from table arrangements to kitchen layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customizable Characters</strong> \u2013 Play as a robot and customize the colors of your parts in your workplace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inspections</strong> \u2013 Keep your kitchen clean and pass inspections successfully. You don\u2019t want your customers to get sick.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587830?t=1743092799","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587830/fcf3a5ee6e4ce13c48e88e6f66d89c02c1e34130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743092799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587830/c2319a06495df416f2fb92772eb9442975524448/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743092799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587830/c2319a06495df416f2fb92772eb9442975524448/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743092799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","i